# AI-Assisted Skincare Social Media Post

This is a practice project created to explore AI-assisted content creation
for social media.

## Project

I created an educational Instagram post about keeping a skincare routine simple.

### AI Usage
- Used AI to generate the initial content and visual concept
- Reviewed and selected the final output
- Refined the content and checked the overall design

### Topic

A simple skincare routine based on three basic steps:
- Cleanse
- Moisturize
- Protect

### Tools Used
- AI image/content generation
- ChatGPT
- Image generation tool

### Purpose

This project demonstrates my ability to use AI tools as part of a
digital content creation workflow.
